<title>GERMANY: Schering sees 10-15 pct profit growth in 97.</title>
<headline>Schering sees 10-15 pct profit growth in 97.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German drugs group Schering AG said on Wednesday it expected to post a 10-15 percent increase in profits in the current year.</p>
<p>The forecast was made by Schering chief financial officer Klaus Pohle at a news briefing detailing its 1996 business results.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
